      "title": "Human Resources",
      "description": "Human Resources - Career Opportunities | SUNY Polytechnic Institute Skip to main content Open Menu second-menu future students current students alumni Faculty + Staff Research Secondary Header search apply visit Request Info Human Resources - Career Opportunities Home Contact Offices Human Resources Human Resources - Career Opportunities Additional Page Navigation New York State Employees Employee Assistance Program Research Foundation Employees Policies + Procedures Visa + Immigration Career Opportunities Contact Us Retiree Resources Thank you for your interest in pursuing a career with the State University of New York Polytechnic Institute (SUNY Poly). SUNY Poly represents a new and necessary model for public and affordable higher education in science, engineering, and technology; one that is cognizant and respectful of the customary academic enterprise, while fostering and enabling the fast evolving culture of discovery and innovation in todayâs knowledge-driven global economy. SUNY Poly supports accelerated high technology education and commercialization, and seeks to create jobs and economic growth for nanotechnology-related industries. More Information/Career Opportunities READY TO GET STARTED? Request More Information Detailed information, brochures and forms can be mailed to you upon request. REQUEST NOW Let's Start The Process Complete and submit your application to SUNY Poly. APPLY NOW Menu Footer 1 Announcements Banner/Degree Works Brightspace D2L Cancelled Classes Career Opportunities Directory Email Media Resources Menu Footer 2 Accessibility Campus Store Offices Wildcat Athletics SUNY Poly Explore Social Network Linkks F T I Y L S Â© 2025-2026 SUNY Polytechnic Institute. All rights reserved. Close Menu Secondary Header search apply visit Request Info second-menu future students current students alumni Faculty + Staff Research menu suny About At a Glance News Campus History Directories Office of the President Mission + Vision Academics Find Your Program Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Catalogs College of Arts + Sciences College of Business College of Engineering College of Health Sciences Academic Minors Admissions Summer Classes The Premier Public Polytechnic Visit Apply Undergraduate Graduate International Online Learning Non-Degree Study Financial Aid Orientation Student Life Student Experience Care Team Housing + Dining Athletics Clubs + Organizations Title IX at SUNY Poly Diversity, Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging Student Resources Research News + Events Office of Research Research Centers Faculty Research Student Research Research Compliance Sponsored Programs Integrated Services Research Foundation Procurement & Travel IP + Licensing Partners Notice: Leaving the sunypoly.edu Website You are now leaving the sunypoly.edu website. By following this link, you will be redirected to a third-party website not operated by SUNY Polytechnic Institute. SUNY Polytechnic Institute is not responsible for the Section 508, ADA, or EIT accessibility compliance of third party web sites. To continue to this external site, click the \"continue\" button below. Continue Go Back Close Search Search SUNY Poly Search"
